          "en": "and can be reused by Dart, as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.12,
          "end": 85.98,
          "en": "And below this SizedBox,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.98,
          "end": 89.43,
          "en": "we then need our buttons for the different answers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.43,
          "end": 91.95,
          "en": "Now, here, I wanna use the ElevatedButton widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.95,
          "end": 94.74000000000001,
          "en": "which is another widget provided by Flutter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.74000000000001,
          "end": 97.08,
          "en": "And for the moment, I'll just set onPressed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.08,
          "end": 99.408,
          "en": "to an empty, anonymous function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.408,
          "end": 101.72999999999999,
          "en": "We'll make sure that we do something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.72999999999999,
          "end": 103.8,
          "en": "more useful here later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.8,
          "end": 106.41,
          "en": "And now we actually have to remove const here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.41,
          "end": 108.21000000000001,
          "en": "because the button isn't const,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.21000000000001,
          "end": 109.92,
          "en": "and we have to add it manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.92,
          "end": 112.17,
          "en": "in front of the widgets that can be const,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.17,
          "end": 113.913,
          "en": "Text and SizedBox.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.006,
          "end": 117.857,
          "en": "And for the child here for this ElevatedButton,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.857,
          "end": 120.09,
          "en": "we wanna use the Text widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.09,
          "end": 122.37,
          "en": "to output some text as part of the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.37,
          "end": 125.49,
          "en": "So, by combining these two widgets as we did it before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.49,
          "end": 126.54,
          "en": "for the Text button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.54,
          "end": 129.54,
          "en": "and the outlined buttons as well in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.54,
          "end": 134.4,
          "en": "And here, the Text would be answer 1 for the first button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.4,
          "end": 137.01,
          "en": "And of course, this can now be repeated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.01,
          "end": 139.239,
          "en": "so that we also have a second answer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.239,
          "end": 142.56,
          "en": "and a third answer and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.56,
          "end": 145.26,
          "en": "Now, soon, this will be generated dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.26,
          "end": 147.077,
          "en": "to really use the actual answers",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.077,
          "end": 149.64,
          "en": "of the question we selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.64,
          "end": 152.25,
          "en": "For the moment, I'll just hard-code it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.25,
          "end": 155.34,
          "en": "If we now save this and force a reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 155.34,
          "end": 158.55,
          "en": "and we go to this Questions page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 158.55,
          "end": 159.66,
          "en": "it looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 159.66,
          "end": 162.84300000000002,
          "en": "And of course, that's not the final look I wanna have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 163.74,
          "end": 165.06,
          "en": "Instead, I wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 165.06,
          "end": 168.75,
          "en": "that we take the full available width here for the column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 170.869,
          "en": "And, I again, wanna make sure that my question",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 170.869,
          "end": 173.163,
          "en": "and the answers are centered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 174.15,
          "end": 176.25,
          "en": "Now, for that, we could use the same approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 176.25,
          "end": 178.05,
          "en": "as we do on the start_screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 178.05,
          "end": 181.11,
          "en": "where we wrap column with a Center widget",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 181.11,
          "end": 184.02,
          "en": "and then set the mainAxisSize on Column",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 184.02,
          "end": 186.54,
          "en": "to MainAxisSize.min.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 186.54,
          "end": 188.46,
          "en": "This would work here as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 188.46,
          "end": 190.83,
          "en": "but to show you also an alternative,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 190.83,
          "end": 194.587,
          "en": "we can wrap this column widget with another widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 194.587,
          "end": 198.03,
          "en": "and that would be the SizedBox widget.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 198.03,
          "end": 201.284,
          "en": "And here, I now wanna set the width to a special value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 201.284,
          "end": 205.05,
          "en": "that will take as much width as is available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 205.05,
          "end": 208.66,
          "en": "So, instead of hard-coding this to a width of 100 pixels",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 208.66,
          "end": 210.36,
          "en": "or anything like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 210.36,
          "end": 213.15,
          "en": "which will probably not be the exact width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 213.15,
          "end": 214.74,
          "en": "of the device we're running on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 214.74,
          "end": 217.53,
          "en": "I can use a special value built into Dart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 217.53,
          "end": 220.143,
          "en": "and that's double.infinity.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 221.1,
          "end": 223.65,
          "en": "Now, that's a special value which simply means,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 223.65,
          "end": 228.42000000000002,
          "en": "use as much width as you can, be as wide as possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 228.42000000000002,
          "end": 229.82999999999998,
          "en": "It's built into Dart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 229.82999999999998,
          "end": 232.53,
          "en": "and we can use it as a value for width here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 232.53,
          "end": 234.45,
          "en": "And with that, you will see that we now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 234.45,
          "end": 236.49,
          "en": "at least take the entire width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 236.49,
          "end": 240.03,
          "en": "To center the questions and the answers vertically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 240.03,
          "end": 243,
          "en": "we then can use another setting inside of column,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 243,
          "end": 246.543,
          "en": "and there, we can set the MainAxisAlignment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 247.56,
          "end": 251.01,
          "en": "You might remember that for mainAxisSize,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 251.01,
          "end": 253.86,
          "en": "I mentioned that the Main Axis for Column",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 253.86,
          "end": 257.55,
          "en": "is the Vertical Axis from top to bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 257.55,
          "end": 259.62,
          "en": "And hence, the mainAxisAlignment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 259.62,
          "end": 262.02,
          "en": "also controls the vertical alignment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 262.02,
          "end": 263.43,
          "en": "so whether it's centered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 263.43,
          "end": 267.39,
          "en": "or if it's at the top or the end of the vertical axis.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 267.39,
          "end": 271.17,
          "en": "And we can set this to one of the built-in values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 271.17,
          "end": 274.293,
          "en": "for example, MainAxisAlignment.center.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 275.43,
          "end": 277.74,
          "en": "And if we do this and save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 277.74,
          "end": 280.95,
          "en": "we now see that this is centered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 280.95,
          "end": 282.48,
          "en": "So, this is an alternative",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 282.48,
          "end": 285.15,
          "en": "to using a center widget as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 285.15,
          "end": 287.43,
          "en": "and setting the main axis size.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 287.43,
          "end": 290.15999999999997,
          "en": "And one possible advantage of this approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 290.15999999999997,
          "end": 292.62,
          "en": "is that you can set the mainAxisAlignment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 292.62,
          "end": 294.658,
          "en": "not just to center, but for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 294.658,
          "end": 298.08,
          "en": "also to spaceAround or spaceBetween.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 298.08,
          "end": 299.97,
          "en": "With spaceAround, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 299.97,
          "end": 304.44,
          "en": "the items would be distributed equally across the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 304.44,
          "end": 305.76,
          "en": "including the size widget,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 305.76,
          "end": 309.57,
          "en": "which is invisible, but also takes up its space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 309.57,
          "end": 310.8,
          "en": "It's not what we need here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 310.8,
          "end": 312.18,
          "en": "but it could be another reason",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 312.18,
          "end": 315.75,
          "en": "for using mainAxisAlignment in certain situations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 315.75,
          "end": 318.87,
          "en": "Here, it's center, which I want though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 318.87,
          "end": 320.783,
          "en": "so that it looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 320.783,
          "end": 324.4,
          "en": "Of course, the colors and so on are not final yet though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 324.4,
          "end": 327.27,
          "en": "And that, therefore, is the next step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 327.27,
          "end": 329.37,
          "en": "I wanna change the question color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 329.37,
          "end": 330.203,
          "en": "and of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 330.203,
